and 30-day business-evaluation offer in this distribution. Separately negotiated
commercial agreements remain governed by their own terms.

Third-party software remains subject to its own licenses. This notice does not
replace or restrict rights granted by those licenses.

Development preview tooling is supplied as-is, without warranty. Production
